  "title": "Mud Tracks & Missing Barges",
  "subtitle": "The Dry Valley Trail",
  "summary": "Follow the diverted wagon ruts past parched farmlands, inspect physical trail evidence, and choose your tactical approach at the river lockhouse.",
  "startNode": "c2_start",
  "nextChapterId": "chapter_03",
  "nodes": {
    "c2_start": {
      "id": "c2_start",
      "backdrop": "dry_farmland",
      "mood": "bleak",
      "particles": "dust",
      "speaker": "myra",
      "speakerName": "Myra",
      "expression": "tired",
      "characters": [
        { "id": "torrik", "expression": "tired", "position": "left", "active": false },
        { "id": "myra", "expression": "tired", "position": "center", "active": true },
        { "id": "orsen", "expression": "neutral", "position": "right", "active": false }
      ],
      "text": "Storm broke west of the ridge, leaving the valley dry as bone dust. Every ditch along these fields should be carrying spring melt—and look at it.",
      "next": "c2_torrik_boots"
    },
    "c2_torrik_boots": {
      "id": "c2_torrik_boots",
      "backdrop": "dry_farmland",
      "mood": "bleak",
      "particles": "dust",
      "speaker": "torrik",
      "speakerName": "Torrik",
      "expression": "worried",
      "characters": [
        { "id": "torrik", "expression": "worried", "position": "left", "active": true },
        { "id": "myra", "expression": "smug", "position": "center", "active": false },
        { "id": "orsen", "expression": "neutral", "position": "right", "active": false }
      ],
      "text": "My guild ledger lists forty sacks of seed barley earmarked for this windmill parish. Instead the mill sails haven't turned in months.",
      "next": "c2_orsen_observation"
    },
    "c2_orsen_observation": {
      "id": "c2_orsen_observation",
      "backdrop": "dry_farmland",
      "mood": "tense",
      "particles": "dust",
      "speaker": "orsen",
      "speakerName": "Orsen",
      "expression": "determined",
      "characters": [
        { "id": "torrik", "expression": "neutral", "position": "left", "active": false },
        { "id": "myra", "expression": "determined", "position": "center", "active": false },
        { "id": "orsen", "expression": "determined", "position": "right", "active": true }
      ],
      "text": "And yet heavy iron-bound carts paused right beside that dry ditch at midnight. Spread out—see what the caravan left behind in the dust.",
      "next": "c2_farmland_inspect"
    },
    "c2_farmland_inspect": {
      "id": "c2_farmland_inspect",
      "backdrop": "dry_farmland",
      "mood": "bleak",
      "particles": "dust",
      "speaker": "myra",
      "speakerName": "Myra",
      "expression": "determined",
      "characters": [
        { "id": "torrik", "expression": "determined", "position": "left", "active": false },
        { "id": "myra", "expression": "determined", "position": "center", "active": true },
        { "id": "orsen", "expression": "neutral", "position": "right", "active": false }
      ],
      "text": "Inspect the abandoned farmland clues: the silent windmill, the fence-line sacks, and the deep wagon furrow.",
      "investigation": {
        "prompt": "Search the Dry Farmland (2 clues required)",
        "requiredCount": 2,
        "continueLabel": "Choose Route to the Lockhouse",
        "continueNext": "c2_road_choice",
        "hotspots": [
          {
            "id": "hs_windmill",
            "label": "Windmill Gearhouse",
            "x": 0.74,
            "y": 0.38,
            "speaker": "myra",
            "speakerName": "Myra",
            "expression": "surprised",
            "text": "Caught on a nail inside the mill door—a crimson manifest ribbon stamped with River Pier 4! That's Great Guild Quartermaster silk.",
            "setFlags": { "found_windmill_ribbon": true },
            "addScore": { "guild_standing": 1 }
          },
          {
            "id": "hs_sacks",
            "label": "Ditchside Grain Sacks",
            "x": 0.24,
            "y": 0.64,
            "speaker": "orsen",
            "speakerName": "Orsen",
            "expression": "angry",
            "text": "Look inside—chaff layered over pig-iron ingots! They masked ward iron inside barley sacks so gate guards wouldn't weigh the axles.",
            "setFlags": { "found_lime_sacks": true },
            "addScore": { "guild_standing": 1 }
          },
          {
            "id": "hs_ruts",
            "label": "Deep Axle Furrow",
            "x": 0.48,
            "y": 0.72,
            "speaker": "torrik",
            "speakerName": "Torrik",
            "expression": "determined",
            "text": "Five distinct wheel gauges, heading straight toward the lower river lockhouse alleys. They're loading barges tonight.",
            "addScore": { "guild_standing": 1 }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "c2_road_choice": {
      "id": "c2_road_choice",
      "backdrop": "dry_farmland",
      "mood": "urgent",
